OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity pauses Shakespeare move
OL,4,Aafter backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe University of Birmingham has paused
OL,7,Fplans to move the Shakespeare Institute
OL,8,Ffrom Stratford-upon-Avon to Birmingham
OL,9,Famid growing opposition to the
OL,10,Fproposal.
OL,12,FThe university said it would spend the
OL,13,Fnext six months working with partners
OL,14,Fincluding the Royal Shakespeare Company
OL,15,F(RSC) and the Shakespeare Birthplace
OL,16,FTrust to explore the institute's future
OL,17,Fin Stratford.
OL,19,FThe decision comes after criticism from
OL,20,FStratford-upon-Avon MP Manuela
OL,21,FPerteghella and a petition that
OL,22,Fattracted more than 12,000 signatures.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
